<title>INDONESIA: BADMINTON-INDONESIA OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-INDONESIA OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-07-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results from the</p>
<p>Indonesia Open badminton championships in Solo on Saturday</p>
<p>(Indonesian unless stated):</p>
<p>Men's singles</p>
<p>Ardi Wiranata beat Heryanto Arbi 15-4 15-5</p>
<p>Marleve Mainaky beat Yong Hock Kim (Malaysia) 15-5 15-5</p>
<p>Women's singles</p>
<p>Susy Susanti beat Lee Joo-hyun (South Korea) 11-1 11-2</p>
<p>Meiluawati beat Ellen Engelina 12-10 11-4</p>
<p>Men's doubles</p>
<p>Yoo Yong-sung/Lee Dong-soo (South Korea) beat Rexy</p>
<p>Mainaky/Ricky Subadja 15-13 2-15 17-14</p>
<p>Budiarto Sigit/Chandra Wijaya beat Antonius Budi Arianto/Denny</p>
<p>Kantono 15-3 17-15</p>
<p>Women's doubles</p>
<p>Resiana Zelin/Eliza beat Marelen Thomson/Lisbet</p>
<p>Stuer-Lauridsen (Denmark) 15-11 15-6</p>
<p>Finarsih/Minarti Timur beat Yoshiko Iwata/Haruko Matsuda</p>
<p>(Japan) 15-8 15-9</p>
<p>Mixed doubles</p>
<p>Bambang Suprianto/Rosalina Risau beat Sandiarto/Finarsih 15-5</p>
<p>18-13</p>
<p>Trikua Haryanto/Minarti Timur beat Iman Tohari/Ema Ermawati</p>
<p>15-6 15-8.</p>
</text>
